{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Action Button" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "操作按钮"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "動作按鈕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Poki and starts talking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Poki 并开始说话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打開 Poki 並開始說話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Poki and starts talking. If Poki is doing a task, it shows that task and leaves it running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Poki 并开始对话。如果 Poki 正在执行任务，会直接显示当前任务并继续运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟 Poki 並開始對話。如果 Poki 正在執行任務，會直接顯示目前任務並繼續執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki couldn’t start the task. The chat says why." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki couldn’t start the task. Open the conversation to see why."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 未能启动该任务，请在对话中查看原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 無法啟動該任務，請在對話中查看原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is still busy, so this task didn’t start. Here is what Poki is doing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在处理其他任务，未启动新任务。以下是当前进度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在處理其他任務，未啟動新任務。以下是目前進度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is busy. Wait for the current task to finish and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在忙，请等当前任务结束后再试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在忙，請等目前的任務結束後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a model in Poki’s settings, then return to Split View and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先在 Poki 的设置里选择模型，再回到分屏重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請先在 Poki 的設定裡選擇模型，再回到分割顯示重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki started the task. Turn Poki on so it can act on the phone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已接收任务。请开启 Poki，以便它操作此 iPhone。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已接收任務。請開啟 Poki，以便它操作此 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki starts the task on this iPhone and tells you when it is done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会在此 iPhone 上执行任务，并在完成后通知你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 會在此 iPhone 上執行任務，並在完成後通知你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki wasn’t ready. Try again in a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 还没准备好，请稍后再试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 還沒準備好，請稍後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and hold the Action button to talk with Poki without leaving the app you’re in. Press and hold it again to end the talk. To open Poki and talk there instead, choose Controls, then Talk to Poki. To type a task, choose Shortcut, then Send Task. Control Center and the Lock Screen can hold Talk to Poki too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住操作按钮即可在不离开当前 App 的情况下与 Poki 说话，再次按住即可结束。如需打开 Poki 再说话，请选择“控制”，再选“和 Poki 说话”；如需输入文字任务，请选择“快捷指令”，再选“发送任务”。控制中心和锁定屏幕也可添加“和 Poki 说话”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住動作按鈕即可在不離開目前 App 的情況下與 Poki 說話，再次按住即可結束。如需開啟 Poki 再說話，請選擇「控制項目」，再選「和 Poki 說話」；如需輸入文字任務，請選擇「捷徑」，再選「傳送任務」。控制中心和鎖定畫面也可加入「和 Poki 說話」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send ${task} to Poki" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 ${task} 发给 Poki"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 ${task} 發給 Poki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send Task" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发任务"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "發任務"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Poki with on-device automation, then open the two apps in Split View and run the shortcut again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先打开 Poki 并启用本机自动化，再将两个 App 摆成分屏，然后重新运行快捷指令。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先開啟 Poki 並啟用裝置上的自動化，再以分割顯示開啟兩個 App，然後重新執行捷徑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Split View" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用分屏"
